Create plugin load test.

Automated test that loads the VST3 plugin binary, verifies it initializes
correctly, processes a buffer of audio, and shuts down cleanly.

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] Test loads VST3 shared library dynamically
- [ ] Calls plugin init/create entry points
- [ ] Processes at least one audio buffer (256 frames)
- [ ] Verifies output buffer is non-zero (for active pattern)
- [ ] Calls shutdown/destroy, verifies clean exit
- [ ] No memory leaks (ASan clean)

## Test Plan
- [ ] Build and run plugin_load_test target
- [ ] Verify plugin initializes without error
- [ ] Verify audio processing produces output
- [ ] Verify shutdown is clean (no leaks, no crashes)
